'Tirna Sarkar’s contributor note describes a Kolkata writer who began writing in her teens and studied English literature. It presents writing as a means of expressing feelings that are difficult to carry or communicate. Her contribution here, “Wings”, gives that inward pressure a sustained physical image.',
